			"type": "yaml",
			"value": "title: Installation\ndescription: Learn how to create a new Next.js application with the `create-next-app` CLI, and set up TypeScript, ESLint, and Module Path Aliases."
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Create a new Next.js app and run it locally."
