		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "txt",
			"meta": "filename=\"Terminal\"",
			"value": "What is your project named? my-app\nWould you like to use the recommended Next.js defaults?\n    Yes, use recommended defaults - TypeScript, ESLint, No React Compiler, Tailwind CSS, No src/ directory, App Router, Cache Components, AGENTS.md\n    No, reuse previous settings\n    No, customize settings - Choose your own preferences"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "If you choose to "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "customize settings"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": ", you'll see the following prompts:"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "txt",
			"meta": "filename=\"Terminal\"",
			"value": "Would you like to use TypeScript? No / Yes\nWhich linter would you like to use? ESLint / Biome / None\nWould you like to use React Compiler? No / Yes\nWould you like to use Tailwind CSS? No / Yes\nWould you like your code inside a `src/` directory? No / Yes\nWould you like to use App Router? (recommended) No / Yes\nWould you like to use Cache Components? No / Yes\nWould you like to customize the import alias (`@/*` by default)? No / Yes\nWhat import alias would you like configured? @/*\nWould you like to include AGENTS.md to guide coding agents to write up-to-date Next.js code? No / Yes"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "After the prompts, "
				},
				{
					"type": "link",
					"title": null,
					"url": "../03-api-reference/06-cli/create-next-app.md",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "inlineCode",
							"value": "create-next-app"
